      "value": "Please add a function to output the viewpoint of the stream camera and Dolly camera and drone camera to NewTek NDI.\n\nI hope that world sdk also has an ndi output function to make the stage videos from mmd world go out as ndi output\n\nTo control this, Please would  to add the world ndi output allowance  option in the vrchat client configuration",
